MinePeak 0.4.1 — final Windows regression suite, 2026-10-31.
Result: PASS; process exit code 0; 196 individual cases in 13 areas.
Portable Linux expectation: 187 cases (the 9 Windows launcher cases are skipped).
Only PASS lines are copied below. Some lines summarize groups and are not additional cases.
Game/runtime UI, native Unity contacts and two real PCs require separate integration testing.

